  "name": "venomancer-spiderling-venoms-do-not-reproduce-brood-lord-6249",
  "contract": [
    "Brood Lord summons Spiderlings when the Venomancer critically strikes an owned webbed target in Spider Form.",
    "Their authored venom application must still damage the target with the owner's active Weakening Venom, but",
    "Spiderling-sourced venom crits must not count as fresh owner strikes and create further Spiderlings. A",
    "normal owner critical venom hit acquires the initial summons; only their attacks occur during the observed",
    "interval. The initial count is snapshotted because the summon payload rolls one or two Spiderlings. All",
    "summons must expire. The first observed pet venom critical hit is checked immediately to bound the failing",
    "baseline. A second normal owner critical hit after refreshing the web must still summon one or two new",
    "Spiderlings. Weakening Venom is activated only after the initial owner crit, so the first later venom crit",
    "must come from a Spiderling. Its activation is removed before the second owner crit to exclude an",
    "independent cast-time venom proc from that control."
  ],
